OL,3,GNEWSABoots has a new owner: Three ways
OL,4,Ait could affect you
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf you have been looking to buy a
OL,7,Fhealth or beauty product, the chances
OL,8,Fare you will have shopped at a Boots
OL,9,Fsomewhere in the UK.
OL,11,FThe pharmacy and retailer is a stalwart
OL,12,Fof Britain's high streets, where it has
OL,13,Fserved generations of customers for
OL,14,Fdecades.
OL,16,FBut now it is set to enter its 178th
OL,17,Fyear under new ownership after an #7bn
OL,18,Fdeal was agreed this week - here's
OL,19,Fthree ways it could affect your
OL,20,Fshopping experience.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
