OL,3,GNEWSABoots has a new owner: Three ways
OL,4,Ait could affect you
OL,5,
OL,6,FUpgrading its portfolio of 1,800 stores
OL,7,Fis high on the list of Boots' new
OL,8,Fowners, Wittington Investments. This is
OL,9,Fthe holding company of the Westons - a
OL,10,Fwealthy and retail-steeped Canadian
OL,11,Ffamily who used to own Selfridges and
OL,12,Fcurrently own several large retailers
OL,13,Facross the Atlantic.
